  "notes": [
    "Radiometric UV-A emitter: optical output is radiant_flux (W) per CIE 127:2007, never photometric (no cd/lm/CCT/CRI).",
    "This document is the U365 peak-wavelength rank (360-370 nm). Forward-voltage ranks (L1..H2) and radiant-flux ranks (P6d22..P8d21) are not separately orderable: a single NCSU276CT shipment contains a Nichia-decided mix of those ranks, so they are encoded as min/max envelopes on forward_voltage and radiant_flux rather than as ordering variants.",
    "Built-in ESD protection device is stated on the cover page but no HBM/MM withstand voltage is quantified in the specification, so esd_withstand_voltage is omitted rather than invented.",
    "MSL level is not stated numerically (reels ship in heat-sealed moisture-proof bags with desiccant), so component.msl is omitted."
  ]
